   "body": "Scope note from ADR 0013 (operator decision 2026-10-28, Q13): this store stays the device master of the fine reading position (page, last message seen, scroll offset), and HFR's own flags remain the cross-platform position. LOT-172 (#311) adds an iCloud KVS mirror of the fine position between the user's Apple devices: debounced, bounded to the most recent topics per HFR account, last writer wins per topic with the newest `updatedAt` kept. Design the record so that it is small (ids and integers, no titles) and carries `updatedAt`.",
